<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-MALLORCA WIN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION PLAYOFF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MALLORCA WIN SPANISH FIRST DIVISION PLAYOFF.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish first division playoff second leg result on Sunday: Rayo Vallecano 2 Mallorca 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Rayo: Diego Klimowicz pen 38, Cortijo 83</p>
<p>Mallorca: Carlos 58.</p>
<p>Halftime 1-0. Aggregate 2-2. Attendance 17,000</p>
<p>Mallorca win on away goals rule and gain promotion from second division. Rayo relegated from first division</p>
</text>
